menu "Orb presentation"

config ORB_UI_SCROLL_EDGE_SOFT
    bool "Consistent soft scroll edges under navigation and toward the bezel"
    default y
    help
        Dissolve exiting list/prose content into the black canvas, with no
        top fade on the first resting row. Keep navigation outside the content
        viewport so glass samples black throughout a fling. Disable for the
        previous surface-specific fade distances in a same-source A/B.

endmenu
